      "level": "avoid",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: شیردهی توصیه نمی‌شود یا باید بین دارو و شیردهی یکی انتخاب شود.",
        "en": "Label: breastfeeding not recommended, or choose between the drug and breastfeeding."
      },
      "quote": "Because the potential for hypoglycemia in nursing infants may exist, a decision should be made whether to discontinue nursing or to discontinue the drug, taking into account the importance of the drug to the mother.",
